{"id":"asche","lemma":"Asche","pos":"noun","rank":2326,"glosses":["ash; ashes","money"],"ipa":"/ˈaʃə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/De-Asche.ogg/De-Asche.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Asche","plural":"Aschen"},"examples":[{"text":"Nach dem Feuer war nur Asche übrig.","en":"After the fire, only ash was left.","words":[{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"fire"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},null,{"g":"rest of, remaining"}]},{"text":"Seine Asche ist hier begraben.","en":"His ashes are buried here.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"to bury"}]},{"text":"Die Asche rauchte noch.","en":"The cinders were still smoking.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to smoke","l":"rauchen"},{"g":"still / yet"}]},{"text":"Das Feuer verbrannte das Haus zu Asche.","en":"The fire reduced the house to ashes.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"fire"},{"g":"to burn","l":"verbrennen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Er streut sich Asche aufs Haupt.","en":"He is doing penance.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to strew","l":"streuen"},{"g":"oneself"},null,null,{"g":"chief"}]}]}